<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - OmniPoint started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - OmniPoint started.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Furman Selz said it initiated coverage of OmniPoint Corp with a neutral rating.</p>
<p>-- said believes OmniPoint needs to &quot;demonstrate several quarters of strong subscriber growth momentum to drive a recovery in its stock price.&quot;</p>
<p>-- set a price target of $19 a share.</p>
<p>-- OmniPoint gained 5/8 to 14-1/2.</p>
</text>
